---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout>
  <h2>mcenahle.care</h2>
  <p>即使是非医学护理专业的，依旧热爱医学专业。</p>
  <p>I'm a happy medical lover who happens to study advertising.</p>

  <div class="panel panel-primary">
    <div class="panel-heading">
      <h3 class="panel-title">关于这里</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <p>
        这里记录我在医学、护理学与生命科学学习过程中遇到的知识、问题与有趣的事情。
      </p>
      <p>内容可能来自课程、教材、公开资料以及个人学习笔记。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel panel-info">
    <div class="panel-heading">
      <h3 class="panel-title">我感兴趣的领域</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <span class="label label-primary">基础医学</span>
      <span class="label label-primary" style="margin-left: 4px;">护理学</span>
      <span class="label label-primary" style="margin-left: 4px;">妇产科学</span
      >
      <span class="label label-primary" style="margin-left: 4px;">口腔医学</span
      >
      <span class="label label-primary" style="margin-left: 4px;">医学史</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel panel-danger">
    <div class="panel-heading">
      <h3 class="panel-title">非医疗建议</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-body">
      <p>
        本站内容主要用于个人学习、知识整理与兴趣分享，不能替代医生的诊断、治疗或其他专业医疗建议。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
